00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:39.570
I challenge you to a duel.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.610
Muneakira, forget about that idiot!

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:43.360
Muneakira!

00:16:43.610 --> 00:16:45.780
So she <i>did</i>  return.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.280
Will she ever learn?

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:48.870
Let's attack at once and get rid of her!

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:50.080
Don't interfere!

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:53.250
I'm the one who she challenged to a duel!

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.620
Onii-chan...

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.630
There's no need to worry.

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:03.470
Muneakira-san should know her power from the fight at noon.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:08.470
Yagyuu Muneakira, how lewd of you to have a harem!

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:12.560
I'll correct your corrupt personality with a smash!

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.980
Prepare yourself!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:22.730
Muneakira!

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:27.240
Were you so busy improving your kissing technique...

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:30.620
that you forgot your sword training?

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.450
What a pitiful gentleman you are!

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:33.750
Muneakira-san...

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.410
Beta-san, Onii-chan's...

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:37.460
Muneakira, stand up!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.000
Why is it? Why?

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:44.300
<i>I'm a hopeless and horrible man.</i>

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:48.800
<i>I was so selfish that I wasn't able to think of your feelings one bit.</i>

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:54.060
Is this all the master of Yagyuu Dojo has to offer?

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:54.810
Stop it!

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:55.850
Stay away!

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.310
Not yet.

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:02.270
This is far from the pain Yukimura felt in her heart!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.200
You could have just honestly asked for help.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:10.120
This is the end!

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:10.870
Stop it!

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:12.620
Stop it...

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:14.870
Kanetsugu...

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:22.790
Muneakira, I didn't want to hurt you.

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:24.170
Yukimura...

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:27.220
I just... I just wanted to say...

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:30.470
I, you know, I...

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:34.890
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:39.100
If I had known things would end up like this, I wouldn't have kissed you!

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:39.770
Yukki.

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:40.690
Yukimura-sama.

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:45.780
Sheesh. It seems like you finally realized the extent of your sins.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:49.070
What's so wrong about wanting to kiss the person you love?

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:51.370
Everything about it.

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.910
I can't accept that as an answer!

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.620
Senhime-sama.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:19:01.540
Princess, I take it you are the only one who retains reason in this immoral beast's nest.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.710
Please tell those brutes what morality is;

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:10.380
why men and women are not to kiss on a whim.

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:11.930
Naoe Kanetsugu.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:15.260
You called yourself The Warrior of Love.

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:20.600
But you don't know of love, as you've never actually loved someone.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:21.480
Am I wrong?

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:23.150
Wh-What are you saying all the sudden?

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:25.440
You would understand if you knew love!

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:30.990
That wanting to kiss someone you love is a natural, noble, and wonderful feeling!

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.780
Do you know that, Naoe Kanetsugu?!

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:35.950
W-Well...

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:40.790
Muneakira, these are my true, honest feelings.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:48.590
No way! Not you too, Senhime-sama!

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.120
S-Senhime-sama...

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.080
Graceful Elegance...

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.540
Tokugawa Sen descends here!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.870
Ohii-sama, how beautiful!

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.260
The duel isn't over yet.

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:35.260
Yagyuu Muneakira, the moment I go easy on you, you even do a lewd act to Senhime-sama!

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:36.850
I won't forgive you now!

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:46.060
I, Tokugawa Sen, will take over in this duel!

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:48.820
I will not hear any objections!

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:50.780
No way...!

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:53.990
Senhime-sama, thank you very much.

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:57.240
You just have to shut up and stay back in these situations!

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:59.990
Figure it out, stupid.

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:08.250
It seems like I need to get a better hold of myself.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.800
I'll be waiting.

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:17.640
She's running away!

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:22.470
With that, I'll let you go for today!

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:25.020
Wait!

00:21:25.390 --> 00:21:29.110
You're under arrest for vandalism and multiple counts of trespassing!

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:30.610
I said I'm leaving!

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:32.030
Hey, wait!

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:33.030
Don't follow me!

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:41.030
The Warrior of
Love Appears

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:13.880
Ohii-sama's lips!

00:23:13.880 --> 00:23:14.750
Um, Hanzou-san?

00:23:14.750 --> 00:23:18.050
This mouth touched Ohii-sama's soft and supple lips!

00:23:18.050 --> 00:23:20.130
Don't pull, please!

00:23:20.130 --> 00:23:25.310
But if I kiss with Muneakira-san right now, wouldn't it be an indirect kiss with Ohii-sama?!

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:28.680
In that case, I'll ignore the fact that I'm also kissing Muneakira-san.

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:33.310
No, wait. If I later make Muneakira-san a dead man, then that one might not count...

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:34.440
That won't work, it won't!

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:35.270
Next time, Hyakka Ryouran:

00:23:35.270 --> 00:23:37.860
Invasion of the
Sea Monster

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:40.240
Don't worry, I'll make sure it won't hurt...

00:23:40.240 --> 00:23:40.990
Invasion of the
Sea Monster
